# Only the `release` and `scratch-release` targets read this file: they compile
# inside the image, so the sources have to reach the build context. The
# goreleaser targets build from a temporary context that goreleaser assembles
# itself (Dockerfile + artifacts), where this file plays no part.
#
# Everything else is noise — and .nelmwave/ in particular would carry decrypted
# secrets into an image layer.
*

!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/

# Belt and braces: these are inside the allowed directories above.
**/.nelmwave/
**/*_test.go
